{
  "episode": "EP001",
  "version": "user-script-v2",
  "fps": 30,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "frames": 3060,
  "duration_seconds": 102.0,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C01",
      "text": "王大富拿金条砸我的门时，锅里的毛肚刚下进去。他在门外喊，十根，全给你，开门。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "78687fde286c2eec83fc11de47ee2b19cd51de42d6279c025d0cfc0bc2c58018",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.360333333333333,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 191,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "cc0ff6abaf80ef291fa5c87be4d67d7ad03594291de4a989cb3084dda3ca1592",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "sample_count": 305296
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C02",
      "text": "我夹起毛肚，涮了七下，隔着门回他，当初在群里说我借钱囤货是傻子的时候，你可没这么客气。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ebf3fd85f5015278d5b65c313b5747076c6951560da102a3b6abb0be0f1728f2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.160854166666667,
      "start_frame": 194,
      "end_frame": 409,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e28efc775803ab108fdca22e2d61f0c986773a8fbd493b32f62fbfbe0c154555",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "sample_count": 343721
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C03",
      "text": "这是血月降临的第一夜。这顿火锅，我准备了九十天。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "9e036aa778374aaab18f5a847284c3839e71b4891629a254b10082487d761725",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.5953958333333333,
      "start_frame": 412,
      "end_frame": 520,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "524248254967a329390619930a9f9d7d0d51373812e73a89050fbf743cf53d2f",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.690438,
      "sample_count": 172579
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C04",
      "text": "九十天前，我还是个被甩锅的仓储主管。马主任说，三十箱货的缺口，签收单上是你的名字。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f2a0d7b694ee90e64780ae2ed43bf61478a42a6d3a5df967e747960e51865741",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.7368125,
      "start_frame": 523,
      "end_frame": 726,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "873b43ca445479db3f70eb782fc638d16a52baf37ddf1400eb6e095facbdd263",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.788781,
      "sample_count": 323367
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C05",
      "text": "我说，是你催我先签的。他一把压住单子，问我，证据呢。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "67a82e8452a9da6fef7773b4cd38dddaae81944038310b526ec55da30dc14e16",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.0793333333333335,
      "start_frame": 729,
      "end_frame": 852,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5f293dc54b47260f2b5cf0a78fa1c6030cd2e21632335591fdcd6471a611d1aa",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.329469,
      "sample_count": 195808
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C06",
      "text": "我摘下工牌，放在桌上。第二天，我就不用再来了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "450820aa89fa6f3489814e3cb71a357fbc4d5c4ea8f619d4a85346ca479c8721",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.7684583333333332,
      "start_frame": 855,
      "end_frame": 969,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f25dd65a79124aa5e72fa8fa8747b6a09dbf4359fcaeec7805537af72c0e78a9",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "sample_count": 180886
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C07",
      "text": "我回到父母留下的老房子，梧桐里三栋一零一，连灯都没开。手机自己亮了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "224a351827ff4c0c6087306302242140b2200cd3cc7dea1a25dae8d2779a9af7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.770958333333334,
      "start_frame": 972,
      "end_frame": 1146,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f05cfbb749bbd194fa2b747e6a85c0dda1f720bbbf59fb82e04217db59a8de4a",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 277006
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C08",
      "text": "方舟安全屋系统，已绑定。下面一行数字，一秒一秒往下跳，距离血月降临，八十九天二十三小时五十九分。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a524e0937650e983323c103a6993e8941812d2fe3ed322385a9c15609a5c9b2c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.397,
      "start_frame": 1149,
      "end_frame": 1401,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "97106f263b99df24dedab16ef4976903792269f77b4ebe5c2945c1cae898455c",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "sample_count": 403056
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C09",
      "text": "我以为是诈骗软件。直到卧室的门，自己弹开一条缝，白光一直照到我的鞋尖。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "60963412f2725a06be31b6ed2defedb6cc6652360f386818f7e74a07073ad9a7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.396833333333333,
      "start_frame": 1404,
      "end_frame": 1566,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "17568b0c1f2160f9633c4fd2b592973680b2b7ee4daf7c935940cf4259e7fdfb",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "sample_count": 259048
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C10",
      "text": "十二平方米的小卧室不见了，门后是一间足有两百平方米的空厅。我扔进去半包泡面，它悬了一秒，无声落地。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "280a4a980e2a458b3c37523ac8dc116673078b9c25f9f91e883803222295be25",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.906354166666667,
      "start_frame": 1569,
      "end_frame": 1807,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b8759804d0883b0a6160794752bd926e7abac55f1f247ec3ce7f017db4f2b490",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "sample_count": 379505
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C11",
      "text": "系统说，屋里的东西不会坏，屋外的怪物进不来。紧接着，一行红字，血月降临后，屋外将不再适合人类生存。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2f17ce9ddddc812dea62db7633817b7323308435594e7faf4b70e441dd4edcd4",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.857145833333333,
      "start_frame": 1810,
      "end_frame": 2046,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a86053270ad2d35e04636f89b47e2da0a24f0c6e17babfe98b2215ea3a5b2879",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "sample_count": 377143
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C12",
      "text": "我盯着银行卡，四十一万两千。又盯着那行倒计时。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ef8bd33fafef4e380f9b76d645a75fde083118766dd5935a56d7f257fe52340a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.8591458333333333,
      "start_frame": 2049,
      "end_frame": 2165,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "10f7e925c2240bed154d918b61cca0aee07dfce0a481a9ce644ea8ace2e3a90f",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "sample_count": 185239
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C13",
      "text": "我打开购物软件，搜索，压缩饼干。顺手又买了两盒草莓，一盒放屋里，一盒放屋外，做个对照。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "65382490d3c1ee04bf93ba7152b9f38f3bdbe3136656ecde732920edca4a6877",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.1963333333333335,
      "start_frame": 2168,
      "end_frame": 2384,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e760d1ff2fa16f068198599efba2d5ca498c31689b3e73c7914b352703d9c53d",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.380875,
      "sample_count": 345424
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C14",
      "text": "第二天，我在业主群问，谁有大米，我收五吨。王大富回我，你是要开粮店，还是脑子坏了。满屏都是哈哈哈。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C14.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "bf1fd365d94e82fb523000f3dea668159e57cd4a4f70456d4dee75d112831b9e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.915395833333333,
      "start_frame": 2387,
      "end_frame": 2625,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C14.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "05cf5761ff3b13aec0efb83aa45c0d2a8911d0365481aa18515de2f46ccc720d",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "sample_count": 379939
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C15",
      "text": "我关掉群聊，心里只有一个字，笑吧。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C15.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "df1f562cad650a2be1d3099a623db77b488e17e15c864e29e10c1a7ba3834bc8",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 2.92925,
      "start_frame": 2628,
      "end_frame": 2716,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C15.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "483c0c6357c84a8f0b7987034b089947c29fb9b05bc0b62043cf426f2a0adf62",
      "source_duration_seconds": 3.831313,
      "sample_count": 140604
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C16",
      "text": "当晚，空厅的墙上，亮起一行红字，警告，检测到同类信号，数量未知。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C16.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0e40b77b7bcba3f8568414edcc6c0e5c8ce0f8d3d8cc86a9672496bee8256025",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.2264375,
      "start_frame": 2719,
      "end_frame": 2906,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C16.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a21c5912d0a2f46d7accf15f3d03965d66acd1288d0ba4cc84d19ccc87551b4b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "sample_count": 298869
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP001-C17",
      "text": "我猛地回头，屋里空无一人。原来，收到倒计时的，不止我一个。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/speed1p3/EP001-C17.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a65c04c151916039efd59c00bda4a7de41f4cbf61874c8a7d0c46cd6a997e510",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.003145833333333,
      "start_frame": 2909,
      "end_frame": 3060,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP001/audio/EP001-C17.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7f4a33eebb8ac34297cfb8a30cf36962a6aca245935dea8495ed32a1050b1b70",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "sample_count": 240151
    }
  ],
